DESCRIPTION:For most of this year\, a slow\, dreamy energy touches your se
 nse of purpose and public path. Your career point gets blurry on purpose: 
 old goals may feel less solid\, and something more soul-aligned tries to s
 urface. This isn't confusion for nothing — it's a quiet redesign of wher
 e you're heading and why. Don't force clarity too soon. Let your intuition
 \, not just logic\, guide career choices these months. → Which part of y
 our path feels ready to be reimagined rather than rushed?\n\n— Technical
  detail: Neptune within orb of conjunction your North Node natal (house 10
 ) · exact: 26/04/26\, 21/09/26\n\n(until Dec 6)
